1269
00:52:49.600 --> 00:52:52.860
Daryl is worried and says, will he be okay?

1270
00:52:53.180 --> 00:52:57.160
And Andy says, the EMT said probably not.

1271
00:52:57.420 --> 00:52:58.440
Oh, my gosh.

